        <p>文本含完整样式、变量、外链、文献引用和术语引用。<named-content content-type="variable">x</named-content><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://example.org/spec"> 官方链接</ext-link><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="biblref_1"> 文献</xref><xref ref-type="custom" custom-type="term-entry" rid="term_2.1"> 术语</xref><xref ref-type="sec" rid="sec_1.1">1.1</xref><inline-formula><mml:math id="mml_m1"><mml:msup><mml:mi>x</mml:mi><mml:mn>2</mml:mn></mml:msup><mml:mo>+</mml:mo><mml:mn>1</mml:mn></mml:math></inline-formula></p>
